.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-share 1  "mnnn-share 2.16.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-share \- Share anything shareable to anything that takes shares: a project, a journal (a new entry about it), a code space (a model or records search as its input; \-\-run runs it) or your exchanges (`net`)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn share\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-note\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-targets\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKIND\fR> [\fIITEM\fR] [\fITARGET\fR] [\fITO\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Share anything shareable to anything that takes shares: a project, a journal (a new entry about it), a code space (a model or records search as its input; \-\-run runs it) or your exchanges (`net`)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-note\fR \fI<NOTE>\fR [default: ]
A note for a journal entry
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-targets\fR
List where this kind of item can be shared
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKIND\fR>
What to share: model, search, journal, project, report, code or pipeline
.TP
[\fIITEM\fR]
The item (id or name)
.TP
[\fITARGET\fR]
Where: project, journal, code or net
.TP
[\fITO\fR]
The project, journal or code space (id or name); for net, exchanges (none: all)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.16.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
